  "abstract": "This submission conducts an ablation study on the `embedding_dim` hyperparameter for the Shared MLP with Learnable Neuron Embeddings. It tests an `embedding_dim` of 4, a smaller size than the previously successful 8, to assess the impact of embedding dimensionality on forecasting accuracy for the ZAPBench dataset.",
